VIZA shorts, Color-Coded Mechanism style (precise-mechanism)

Code: built on the lemo-opuscar library (style demo shader, gears.js, film-outline.js, render and audio tools), used from $LIB.
Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, from github.com/google/fonts, licence texts in fonts/):
  Inter, Noto Sans SC, IBM Plex Mono.
Samples: VCSL (Versilian Community Sample Library), CC0 1.0: harp, marimba, glockenspiel, vibraphone, bowed vibraphone
  (exact lines written to out/<name>/instruments.txt on every build).
Voice: the VideoSpec's own voice file (public/voice/), used as given.
Brand: VIZA logotype (public/brand/viza-logotype-light.svg), VIZA's own mark, used as drawn.
Foley and the 3D machine are generated in code.
